Number = {2},
Month = {JAN},
Abstract = {Two sufficiency theorems for parametric and a nonparametric problems of
   Bolza in optimal control are derived. The dynamics of the problems are
   nonlinear, the initial and final states are free, and the main results
   can be applied when nonlinear mixed time-state-control inequality and
   equality constraints are presented. The deviation between admissible
   costs and optimal costs around the optimal control is estimated by
   functionals playing the role of the square of some norms.},
